settings-integrations-plasma-card = KDE Plasma
settings-integrations-plasma-card-desc = Connect skwd-wall to the Plasma desktop. Lock-screen wallpaper options are configured below.
settings-integrations-lock-mode-label = Lock-screen wallpaper
settings-integrations-lock-mode-desc = Unmanaged leaves Plasma alone. Static always uses the image below. Follow tracks the most recently applied wallpaper.
settings-integrations-lock-off = Unmanaged
settings-integrations-lock-static = Static image
settings-integrations-lock-follow = Follow last applied
settings-integrations-lock-image-label = Image
settings-integrations-lock-image-desc = Absolute path, or a path beginning with ~/. Plasma's built-in image wallpaper displays it on the lock screen.
settings-integrations-lock-dynamic-label = Videos & scenes
settings-integrations-lock-dynamic-desc = Poster frame shows one silent image with no decoder. Live plays videos and scenes, with one renderer per locked display.
settings-integrations-lock-poster = Poster frame
settings-integrations-lock-live = Live (experimental)
settings-integrations-noctalia-card = Noctalia
settings-integrations-noctalia-card-desc = Use these options when Noctalia generates the colours or receives a colour scheme from Skwd.
settings-integrations-noctalia-mode-label = Noctalia theme mode
settings-integrations-noctalia-mode-desc = Apply this mode with each colour scheme. Follow Skwd uses Skwd's resolved light or dark mode; Noctalia's schedule uses its sunrise and sunset settings. Keep leaves Noctalia's current choice unchanged. Bars and panels follow only when Noctalia's shell mode follows the theme mode. Hover previews keep the current mode.
settings-integrations-noctalia-mode-follow = Follow Skwd
settings-integrations-noctalia-mode-keep = Keep Noctalia's mode
settings-integrations-noctalia-mode-dark = Dark
settings-integrations-noctalia-mode-light = Light
settings-integrations-noctalia-mode-auto = Noctalia's schedule
settings-integrations-noctalia-hover-label = Hover colour preview in Noctalia
settings-integrations-noctalia-hover-desc = Hovering a wallpaper temporarily recolours Noctalia's bar, panels, and templates. The saved scheme returns when the hover ends.
settings-integrations-noctalia-bin-label = Noctalia binary
settings-integrations-noctalia-bin-desc = Path to the noctalia binary if it is not on PATH.
settings-integrations-dms-card = Dank Material Shell
settings-integrations-dms-card-desc = When DMS controls colour, skwd-wall writes its Matugen scheme to dms-colors.json. DMS must use the Auto (wallpaper) theme.
settings-integrations-dms-hover-label = Hover colour preview in DMS
settings-integrations-dms-hover-desc = Hovering a wallpaper temporarily rewrites dms-colors.json. The original colours return when the hover ends.
